<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea to import 72 mln bbls of crude in April.</title>
<headline>S.Korea to import 72 mln bbls of crude in April.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korean oil refiners plan to import 72 million barrels of crude oil this month against an estimated 82 million barrels last month, a ministry official said on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
